back overlay text.\n- Ensure screen readers announce scan results via `aria-live` region or equivalent.\n\n**6. Edge Cases**\n- Handle scanner initialization failure gracefully (camera denied, camera absent) with a user-friendly fallback message and optional retry.\n- Prevent volume from exceeding system maximum per OS/browser.\n- Maintain label consistency across all locales — ensure all new strings exist in every supported language file.\n- Test on desktop (Chrome, Firefox, Safari) and mobile (iOS Safari, Chrome Android).\n- Verify scanner robustness across viewport sizes and device orientations.",
